        "original_id": "64ec2946-a0f9-580f-9dac-0e671ca02732",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rafael Nadal, Serena Williams\n- Events: 2013 US Open Series, 2013 Bank of the West Classic, US Open\n- Roles: World No. 1, US Open Series winners\n- Topics: tennis prize bonuses\n\nFacts:\n- The 2013 Bank of the West Classic was the first event on the 2013 US Open Series.\n- Rafael Nadal and Serena Williams were the winners of the 2013 US Open Series.\n- Rafael Nadal and Serena Williams became eligible for a $1 million bonus each if they also won the US Open.\n- Rafael Nadal and Serena Williams both won the US Open and earned the bonus.\n- Rafael Nadal and Serena Williams each received $3.6 million, the largest paycheck to date for a single tennis tournament.\n- Rafael Nadal, also known as Rafael \"Rafa\" Nadal Parera, was born on 3 June 1986.\n- Rafael Nadal is a Spanish professional tennis player.\n- Rafael Nadal was ranked World No. 1 in men's singles.",
